WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.816
Use this slide as practice Work in small steps
predict the result and explain

00:00:05.829 --> 00:00:11.394
why your result makes sense Foundation say hello
Define and call

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:17.988
a simple function Before running the code predict
the output Run

00:00:18.014 --> 00:00:22.619
the example in the browser inspect the result then
change one input or value and

00:00:22.646 --> 00:00:27.685
run it again Focus on what changed and why rather
than reading the code character

00:00:27.711 --> 00:00:28.514
by character
